# Ashtabula County, Ohio
## November 3, 2026 General Election Voter Guide

<p class="lead">A strictly nonpartisan guide to every race and measure on your ballot. No endorsements. Every claim linked to its source.</p>

<div class="key-dates">
  <h2>Key Dates</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Election Day:</strong> Tuesday, November 3, 2026 (polls 6:30am-7:30pm)</li>
    <li><strong>Early voting:</strong> October 6 - November 1 at BOE (8 W Walnut St, Jefferson)</li>
    <li><strong>Absentee application deadline:</strong> October 27 by 8:30pm</li>
    <li><strong>Ballot return:</strong> Must be RECEIVED by 7:30pm Nov 3. Postmarks do not count.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href="https://www.boe.ohio.gov/ashtabula/">Ashtabula County Board of Elections</a> | 440-576-6915 | <a href="https://voteohio.gov/track">Track your ballot</a></p>
</div>

